# NET MINUS TWO. MINUS EIGHT: the pre-v4 `.nav-menu` topbar-dropdown block is retired — `.nav-menu`,
# `.nav-menu-trigger`, `.nav-menu-trigger::-webkit-details-marker`, `.nav-caret`,
