# `.nav-spacer` heads only gained declarations. Two selectors also left the shared
# focus-ring comma group and one joined it — that is a group's CONTENTS, not a head,
# so it moves this number by zero.
# FOR THE LEAD: sibling slices in W14 also touch app.css. Re-measure on the merge
# (charter D158 REGENERATE-ON-REBASE) — a down-bump and an up-bump merge clean and
